{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>大角咀有人疑猝斃。今日（14日）中午1時05分，警方接獲一名49歲姓李男子的家人報案，指近日與李男失去聯絡，憂心其安危。</p><p>警方趕至李男居住的大角咀道73A號興旺大樓調查，發現他倒臥單位洗手間，並已明顯死亡；其死因尚有待驗屍確定。據悉，李男生前曾身患疾病。</p><figure><img alt=\"一名49歲男子與家人失聯，警方登門揭他倒斃於大角咀興旺大樓家中。（Google Maps截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261114/1198315923564400640452970.png/j-RM9oMCQVDtfhp8iAoJR4Cv5-7LBjQb69Hbj-vR248\"/><figcaption>一名49歲男子與家人失聯，警方登門揭他倒斃於大角咀興旺大樓家中。（Google Maps截圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T09:22:49.203055+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":175,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T08:54:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T10:16:54.120650+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T09:16:14.437148+00:00","content_hash":"7d6c9b977284f35e721be9d476136bb933813a7b4af1bdace56c11605a4fecb3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}